<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Whatever Makes You Happy</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Sugababes</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Three</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">34QjXOC90Rd80g1Douxdsa</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.870" end="00:27.240">You ain't gotta make it hard if it's easy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.240" end="00:29.640">Applying pressure on the wound when it's bleeding</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.640" end="00:32.160">Hangin' with the guys 'cos it's just cool being me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.160" end="00:34.530">Too much talking from the girls drive me crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.530" end="00:36.990">You're telling me your definition of a pop star</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.990" end="00:39.780">You give a smile as you cover up your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.780" end="00:41.280">So tell me what to say and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.890" end="00:42.390">I'll deliver it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.940" end="00:43.440">I won't stop, can't stop, 'cos</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.200" end="00:44.700">I'm living it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.470" end="00:45.030">Whatever makes you happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.030" end="00:47.190">Is it crazy to be happy?'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.190" end="00:53.070">Cos it's doing it for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.070" end="00:55.080">Is it making you crazy that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.080" end="00:56.580">I'm happy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.710" end="01:03.710">Lately, you ain't doing it for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.870" end="01:06.480">Now let me break it down tell you what it means to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.480" end="01:08.040">I don't wanna spend my time in the</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.040" end="01:11.130">VIPI gotta meet someone who doesn't need publicity'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.130" end="01:13.740">Cos your style this time ain't impressing me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.740" end="01:15.690">And you can justify everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.690" end="01:18.870">But it don't really matter when reality kicks in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.870" end="01:20.370">So tell me what to say and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.010" end="01:21.510">I'll deliver it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.060" end="01:22.560">I won't stop, can't stop, 'cos</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.500" end="01:24.000">I'm living it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.800" end="01:24.300">Whatever makes you happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.180" end="01:26.340">Is it crazy to be happy?'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.340" end="01:32.190">Cos it's doing it for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.190" end="01:34.230">Is it making you crazy that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.230" end="01:35.730">I'm happy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.890" end="01:41.970">Lately, you ain't doing it for me(You ain't doing it for me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.970" end="01:43.830">So whatever makes you happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.830" end="01:45.900">Is it crazy to be happy?'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.900" end="01:51.780">Cos it's doing it for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.780" end="01:54.150">Is it making you crazy that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.150" end="01:55.650">I'm happy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.390" end="01:59.610">Lately, you ain't doing it for me(You ain't doing it for me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.610" end="02:06.270">I'm finding out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.270" end="02:07.770">I don't wanna be in this place'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.260" end="02:15.260">Cos it's about the music, not the fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.030" end="02:22.860">So whatever makes you happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.860" end="02:25.050">Is it crazy to be happy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.050" end="02:31.230">Cos it's doing it for me('Cos it's doing it for me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.230" end="02:32.940">Is it making you crazy that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.940" end="02:34.440">I'm happy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.660" end="02:40.740">Lately, you ain't doing it for me(You ain't doing it for me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.740" end="02:42.540">So whatever makes you happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.540" end="02:44.490">Is it crazy to be happy?'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.490" end="02:50.520">Cos it's doing it for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.520" end="02:52.590">Is it making you crazy that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.590" end="02:54.090">I'm happy?(Crazy, happy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.040" end="03:00.330">Lately, you ain't doing it for me(You ain't doing it for me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.330" end="03:01.980">So whatever makes you happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.980" end="03:04.290">Is it crazy to be happy?'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.290" end="03:08.290">Cos it's doing it for me</p></div></body></tt>